  "notes": {
    "dashrules": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Dashboard rules\n\nEvery list page: page header → DataTable (tabs, search, filter dropdowns, row actions, numbered pages).\nAdd / edit / view open in a right drawer. Archive, restore, reject, cancel, remove confirm in a modal.\n\nRole changes use permissions + tweaks: open a board’s Tweaks to switch farmer / Group Manager / Kaluppa.\n\nChart colors (validated): varieties Liberica #2a78d6, Excelsa #eb6834, Robusta #1baf7a, Arabica #eda100. Stages: Newly planted #2a78d6, Growing #eb6834, Flowering #1baf7a, Fruiting #eda100, Damaged #e87ba4. One-series charts use Roast #7B4A2A. Always show a legend + table view.",
      "w": 500,
      "x": -620,
      "y": 12400
    },
    "palette": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Look: AgriCentral's layout language in coffee tones.\n\nEspresso #2B1A12 — headings, dark bands\nRoast #7B4A2A — buttons, links, focus\nCaramel #C8913A — icon tiles, stars, decor (never body text)\nCrema #F7EFE4 — soft sections\nFoam #F5F0EA — app background\nSand #E7DCCD — borders\n\nType: Poppins. 5px controls, 8px cards, thin borders, long soft hover shadows.\n\nPhoto boxes are placeholders: the seeder fills them with real stock photos.",
      "w": 500,
      "x": -620,
      "y": 0
